+ *                                ingress traffic
+ * @ingress_extended_vlan_block_id: Extended VLAN block allocated for
+ *                                  ingress traffic
+ * @ingress_extended_vlan_block_size: Extended VLAN block size for ingress
+ *                                    traffic
